{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2 Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Metis: Shadow Days&quot; is a soft science fiction visual novel game featuring simulation management gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-Cold War world, you will take on the role of a fuher of field department at Metis Biological Institute. Through repeated observation trips, you will witness the personnel changes amidst the past trends and seek the origins and truths of fluctuations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/d8b742f523378101d706c747a2e89a48.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/89f9a04a9e305eb2077eb8c8ca391526.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>\u25b2 Observation and exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In repeated observations, I travel through various scenes set in different times, witnessing the changes in people and affairs amidst the passing trends of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/37c60f957b8f8920e28a6b5d465528f5.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2 Medium collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring fluctuation energy media with different characteristics, various fluctuation industrial devices can be synthesized to facilitate subsequent observations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/30898bcbcc0111c320a81f87ce4ff9ae.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Fluctuation monitoring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor fluctuation indicators and industrial equipment conditions around the world to prepare for potential fluctuating storms that may arise at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/8d5b32af53a64c43690e91e8cb3ecb6a.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/ff33757d9ce7ade4a3ab5f8c0df560d3.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>\u25b2 Simulated management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the Sparse Moontain Trading Center, manage and trade a wide variety of media and goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/f8ba9d963500231dfdb406768a9a0a92.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137670?t=1773145346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773145346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/f48f7873c95d2f30e87ebb2159d7b67a797691a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773145346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/f48f7873c95d2f30e87ebb2159d7b67a797691a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773145346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3174030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2 Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Metis: Shadow Days&quot; is a soft science fiction visual novel game featuring simulation management gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-Cold War world, you will take on the role of a fuher of field department at Metis Biological Institute. Through repeated observation trips, you will witness the personnel changes amidst the past trends and seek the origins and truths of fluctuations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/d8b742f523378101d706c747a2e89a48.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/89f9a04a9e305eb2077eb8c8ca391526.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>\u25b2 Observation and exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In repeated observations, I travel through various scenes set in different times, witnessing the changes in people and affairs amidst the passing trends of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/37c60f957b8f8920e28a6b5d465528f5.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2 Medium collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring fluctuation energy media with different characteristics, various fluctuation industrial devices can be synthesized to facilitate subsequent observations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137670/extras/30898bcbcc0111c320a81f87ce4ff9ae.avif?t=1773145346\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Fluctuation monitoring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor fluctuation indicators and indus